## Self-check quiz




::: {.quiz-q data-qid="qr1" data-type="mcq" data-hash="57eo8r.ifptbh" data-show="VGhlIG51bWJlciB1cGRhdGVzIHdpdGggdGhlIGRhdGEsIHNvIHRleHQgYW5kIHJlc3VsdHMg
YWdyZWU=" data-explain="SW5saW5lIGNvZGUgaXMgcmUtcnVuIG9uIGV2ZXJ5IHJlbmRlciwgc28gdGhlIHRleHQgbmV2
ZXIgZHJpZnRzIGZyb20gdGhlIGFuYWx5c2lzLg=="}
Why write `r mean(age)` inline instead of typing the number into the text?

- Inline code makes the whole document render more quickly
- The number updates with the data, so text and results agree
- Typed numbers cannot be formatted to a fixed number of decimals
- Quarto refuses to render typed numbers
:::

::: {.quiz-q data-qid="qr2" data-type="mcq" data-hash="57f1hf.ifq7st" data-show="UnVucyB0aGUgY2h1bmsgYnV0IHNob3dzIG5laXRoZXIgY29kZSBub3Igb3V0cHV0" data-explain="aW5jbHVkZTogZmFsc2UgcnVucyB0aGUgY29kZSAoc28gcGFja2FnZXMgYW5kIGRhdGEgYXJl
IGxvYWRlZCkgYnV0IGtlZXBzIGl0IGFuZCBpdHMgb3V0cHV0IG91dCBvZiB0aGUgZG9jdW1l
bnQu"}
What does `#| include: false` do to a setup chunk?

- Runs the chunk but shows neither code nor output
- Skips the chunk when rendering, so its code is not run
- Shows the code but hides any messages
- Moves the chunk to the end of the document
:::

::: {.quiz-q data-qid="qr3" data-type="mcq" data-hash="57feq5.ifqma7" data-show="Q3Jvc3MtcmVmZXJlbmNlcyBzdWNoIGFzIGBAZmlnLWFnZWA=" data-explain="TGFiZWxzIHN0YXJ0aW5nIHdpdGggZmlnLSAoYW5kIHRibC0gZm9yIHRhYmxlcykgYXJlIG51
bWJlcmVkIGFuZCBjYW4gYmUgY3Jvc3MtcmVmZXJlbmNlZCBpbiB0aGUgdGV4dC4="}
A figure chunk has `#| label: fig-age`. What does the fig- prefix allow?

- Saving the figure to a separate file
- Cross-references such as `@fig-age`
- Changing the size of the figure on the page
- Hiding the figure in the HTML output
:::

